      "name": "What are the best alternatives to SiteGuru?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "As of October 18, 2026, alternatives to SiteGuru in marketing-seo on the Manufact MCP catalog include Buzzfy, Airefs AI Visibility, TalkGenAI, RankControl, and attentive-mcp-server."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Does SiteGuru MCP require authentication?",
